# Tic-Tac-Toe Game (WinForms) 🎮

A classic Tic-Tac-Toe game developed using **C#** and **.NET Framework**. The project focuses on creating a clean UI with a professional wood-themed design and robust game logic.

## ✨ Features
*   **Custom UI:** Beautiful wood-textured interface designed with Windows Forms.
*   **Dynamic Logic:** Accurate win/draw detection using custom algorithms.
*   **Player Interaction:** Visual indicators for turns and status updates.
*   **Reset Functionality:** Easily restart the game session with a single click.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
*   **Language:** C#
*   **Framework:** .NET Framework (Windows Forms)
*   **Tools:** Visual Studio

